msgid "环境变量与编译选项"
msgstr "Environment Variables and Compilation Options"

msgid "本文面向Triton-Ascend算子开发者，提供编译、运行、调试和自动调优配置的查阅入口，说明各配置项的用途、默认值及A2/A3、950支持情况。环境变量用于设置进程内的编译与运行行为，编译选项用于配置单个kernel；环境变量也可以不经启动脚本，直接通过 `triton.knobs`（含Ascend专用的 `triton.knobs.ascend` 分组）在进程内读写。旧配置的迁移方式集中在文末的[编译选项清理与兼容性](#compiler-option-cleanup-and-compatibility)。"
msgstr "This document targets Triton-Ascend operator developers. It provides a reference for compilation, running, debugging, and autotuning configurations. It explains the purpose, default values, and support status for A2/A3 and 950 for each configuration option. Environment variables set the compilation and running behaviors within a process. Compilation options configure a single kernel. You can also read and write environment variables directly within a process by using `triton.knobs` (including the Ascend-specific `triton.knobs.ascend` group) without using a startup script. The migration methods for old configurations are detailed in [Compiler Option Cleanup and Compatibility](#compiler-option-cleanup-and-compatibility) at the end of this document."

msgid "环境变量"
msgstr "Environment Variables"

msgid "环境变量用法示例"
msgstr "Environment variable usage examples"

msgid "在启动Python程序前，使用 `export` 设置环境变量。例如，设置 `TRITON_DEBUG=1` 开启调试功能："
msgstr "Before starting a Python program, use `export` to set environment variables. For example, set `TRITON_DEBUG=1` to enable debugging:"

msgid ""
"export TRITON_DEBUG=1\n"
"python3 run_kernel.py\n"
msgstr ""
"export TRITON_DEBUG=1\n"
"python3 run_kernel.py\n"

msgid "`export` 设置的变量会被当前终端后续启动的程序继承。若只需为一次运行设置变量，可将赋值写在命令前："
msgstr "Variables set using `export` are inherited by programs started later in the current terminal. If you only need to set the variable for a single run, write the assignment before the command:"

msgid ""
"TRITON_DEBUG=1 python3 run_kernel.py\n"
msgstr ""
"TRITON_DEBUG=1 python3 run_kernel.py\n"

msgid "环境变量参考表"
msgstr "Environment Variable Reference Table"

msgid "950列包含Ascend 950PR/950DT；“—”表示不适用，编译模式限制见[编译选项参考表](#compiler-options-reference)。布尔环境变量除特别注明外可用 `1` 启用。"
msgstr "The 950 column includes Ascend 950PR/950DT; \"—\" indicates not applicable. For compilation mode restrictions, refer to the [compiler options reference table](#compiler-options-reference). You can enable Boolean environment variables using `1` unless otherwise specified."

msgid "类别"
msgstr "Category"

msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Function Description"

msgid "默认值"
msgstr "Default value"

msgid "A2/A3"
msgstr "A2/A3"

msgid "950"
msgstr "950"

msgid "调试"
msgstr "Debugging"

msgid "`TRITON_DEBUG`"
msgstr "`TRITON_DEBUG`"

msgid "开启JIT调试及设备断言，保存TTIR；常规路径还输出编译日志并保存后端IR与二进制。"
msgstr "Enables JIT debugging and device assertions, and saves TTIR. The regular path also outputs compilation logs and saves the backend IR and binaries."

msgid "关闭"
msgstr "Disable"

msgid "支持"
msgstr "Support"

msgid "`USE_IR_LOC`"
msgstr "`USE_IR_LOC`"

msgid "以指定阶段的IR文件行号重建位置信息；当前AST编译可用 `ttir`，IR输入还可使用源文件位置快照。"
msgstr "Reconstruct position information using the IR file line numbers at a specified stage; currently, AST compilation can use `ttir`, and IR input can also use source file position snapshots."

msgid "未设置"
msgstr "Not set"

msgid "`TRITON_FRONT_END_DEBUGGING`"
msgstr "`TRITON_FRONT_END_DEBUGGING`"

msgid "前端错误发生时保留原始Python异常堆栈。"
msgstr "Retains the original Python exception stack trace when a frontend error occurs."

msgid "`TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP`"
msgstr "`TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP`"

msgid "保存编译阶段产物及最终 `npubin`；只对实际发生的编译生效。"
msgstr "Save the compilation phase artifacts and the final `npubin`; this takes effect only for actual compilations."

msgid "`TRITON_DUMP_DIR`"
msgstr "`TRITON_DUMP_DIR`"

msgid "指定 `TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP` 的输出目录。"
msgstr "Specifies the output directory for `TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP`."

msgid "`$TRITON_HOME/.triton/dump`"
msgstr "`$TRITON_HOME/.triton/dump`"

msgid "`TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO`"
msgstr "`TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO`"

msgid "`true/1` 禁止向毕昇编译器请求行号信息；`false/0` 启用。"
msgstr "`true/1` prohibits requesting line number information from the BiSheng compiler; `false/0` enables it."

msgid "`true`"
msgstr "`true`"

msgid "常规路径"
msgstr "Standard path"

msgid "`LLVM_EXTRACT_DI_LOCAL_VARIABLES`"
msgstr "`LLVM_EXTRACT_DI_LOCAL_VARIABLES`"

msgid "请求毕昇编译器生成调试变量信息。"
msgstr "Requests the BiSheng compiler to generate debug variable information."

msgid "`TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT`"
msgstr "`TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT`"

msgid "启用 `tl.device_print` 的设备端GM打印缓冲区。"
msgstr "Enables the device-side GM print buffer for `tl.device_print`."

msgid "`TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY`"
msgstr "`TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY`"

msgid "请求编译器输出内存使用信息。"
msgstr "Requests the compiler to output memory usage information."

msgid "—"
msgstr "—"

msgid "`ENABLE_PRINT_UB_BITS`"
msgstr "`ENABLE_PRINT_UB_BITS`"

msgid "请求编译器打印UB占用位数。"
msgstr "Requests the compiler to print the UB occupancy bits."

msgid "`TRITON_INTERPRET`"
msgstr "`TRITON_INTERPRET`"

msgid "在CPU解释器中执行其支持的Triton操作，便于Python断点调试。"
msgstr "Executes supported Triton operations in the CPU interpreter to facilitate Python breakpoint debugging."

msgid "`TRITON_ENABLE_SANITIZER`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ENABLE_SANITIZER`"

msgid "向Ascend NPU编译器传入sanitizer开关。"
msgstr "Pass the sanitizer flag to the Ascend NPU compiler."

msgid "编译"
msgstr "Compilation"

msgid "`TRITON_ALWAYS_COMPILE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ALWAYS_COMPILE`"

msgid "忽略命中的编译缓存，强制重新编译。"
msgstr "Ignore the matched compilation cache and force recompilation."

msgid "`TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE`"

msgid "从覆盖目录读取与编译阶段同名的外部IR/二进制文件。"
msgstr "Read external IR/binary files with the same name as the compilation phase from the override directory."

msgid "`TRITON_OVERRIDE_DIR`"
msgstr "`TRITON_OVERRIDE_DIR`"

msgid "指定覆盖文件目录。"
msgstr "Specifies the override file directory."

msgid "`$TRITON_HOME/.triton/override`"
msgstr "`$TRITON_HOME/.triton/override`"

msgid "`TRITON_F32_DEFAULT`"
msgstr "`TRITON_F32_DEFAULT`"

msgid "设置 `tl.dot` 的默认F32输入精度；Ascend使用 `ieee`、`hf32`，兼容输入 `tf32` 会映射为 `hf32`。"
msgstr "Sets the default F32 input precision for `tl.dot`; Ascend uses `ieee` and `hf32`, and the compatible input `tf32` is mapped to `hf32`."

msgid "未设置，使用后端的 `ieee`"
msgstr "If not set, uses the backend `ieee`"

msgid "`TRITON_ALLOW_NON_CONSTEXPR_GLOBALS`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ALLOW_NON_CONSTEXPR_GLOBALS`"

msgid "允许JIT前端引用非 `constexpr` 全局变量。"
msgstr "Allows the JIT frontend to reference non-`constexpr` global variables."

msgid "`TRITON_ENABLE_LIBDEVICE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ENABLE_LIBDEVICE`"

msgid "在A2/A3编译路径额外链接libdevice；非空字符串均视为开启，包括 `\"0\"`。"
msgstr "Additionally links libdevice in the A2/A3 compilation path; any non-empty string is treated as enabled, including `\"0\"`."

msgid "`TRITON_ENABLE_LIBDEVICE_SIMT`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ENABLE_LIBDEVICE_SIMT`"

msgid "在950上为libdevice调用选择SIMT版本；非空字符串均视为开启，包括 `\"0\"`。"
msgstr "Select the SIMT version for libdevice calls on 950; any non-empty string is considered enabled, including `\"0\"`."

msgid "缓存与调优"
msgstr "Cache and Tuning"

msgid "`TRITON_ASCEND_ENABLE_DYNAMIC_REUSE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ASCEND_ENABLE_DYNAMIC_REUSE`"

msgid "控制符合条件的 `constexpr` 参数变化时的kernel自动复用：`0` 关闭，`1` 启用动态化，`2` 额外启用tile复用和后台编译。"
msgstr "Controls the automatic reuse of kernels when qualified `constexpr` parameters change: `0` disables it, `1` enables dynamization, and `2` additionally enables tile reuse and background compilation."

msgid "`0`"
msgstr "`0`"

msgid "支持；`simt_only` 不支持tile复用"
msgstr "Supported; `simt_only` does not support tile reuse"

msgid "`TRITON_HOME`"
msgstr "`TRITON_HOME`"

msgid "设置Triton缓存、dump和override目录的根位置。"
msgstr "Set the root location for the Triton cache, dump, and override directories."

msgid "用户主目录"
msgstr "user home directory"

msgid "`TRITON_CACHE_DIR`"
msgstr "`TRITON_CACHE_DIR`"

msgid "指定编译缓存目录。"
msgstr "Specifies the compilation cache directory."

msgid "`$TRITON_HOME/.triton/cache`"
msgstr "`$TRITON_HOME/.triton/cache`"

msgid "`TRITON_CACHE_AUTOTUNING`"
msgstr "`TRITON_CACHE_AUTOTUNING`"

msgid "缓存autotune的选择结果。"
msgstr "Cache the autotune selection results."

msgid "`TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING`"
msgstr "`TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING`"

msgid "设为 `1` 时打印autotune结果及常规路径的编译命令。"
msgstr "If you set this to `1`, it prints the autotune results and the compilation commands for the normal path."

msgid "`TRITON_CACHE_MANAGER`"
msgstr "`TRITON_CACHE_MANAGER`"

msgid "用 `MODULE:CLASS` 指定编译缓存管理器；远程缓存设为 `triton.runtime.cache:RemoteCacheManager`。"
msgstr "Use `MODULE:CLASS` to specify the compilation cache manager; set the remote cache to `triton.runtime.cache:RemoteCacheManager`."

msgid "本地缓存管理器"
msgstr "Local Cache Manager"

msgid "`TRITON_REMOTE_CACHE_BACKEND`"
msgstr "`TRITON_REMOTE_CACHE_BACKEND`"

msgid "用 `MODULE:CLASS` 指定远程缓存的存储后端，需配合远程缓存管理器使用。"
msgstr "Use `MODULE:CLASS` to specify the storage backend for the remote cache. It must be used together with the remote cache manager."

msgid "`TRITON_ENABLE_UBTUNER`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ENABLE_UBTUNER`"

msgid "选择UB调优模式：`compile` 或 `run`。"
msgstr "Select a UB tuning mode: `compile` or `run`."

msgid "`TRITON_AUTOTUNE_PARALLEL_COMPILE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_AUTOTUNE_PARALLEL_COMPILE`"

msgid "控制Ascend autotune的并行编译，`0` 关闭。"
msgstr "Controls the parallel compilation of Ascend autotune. `0` disables this feature."

msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

msgid "`TRITON_BENCH_METHOD`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BENCH_METHOD`"

msgid "设为 `npu` 时选择Ascend的 `do_bench_npu`；`default` 使用通用测量方法。"
msgstr "When set to `npu`, Ascend's `do_bench_npu` is selected; when set to `default`, the general measurement method is used."

msgid "`default`"
msgstr "`default`"

msgid "运行"
msgstr "Run"

msgid "`TRITON_COMPILE_ONLY`"
msgstr "`TRITON_COMPILE_ONLY`"

msgid "设为 `1/true` 时不启动kernel；编译及launcher扩展加载仍会执行。"
msgstr "When set to `1/true`, the kernel is not launched; compilation and launcher extension loading still execute."

msgid "`TRITON_ENABLE_TASKQUEUE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ENABLE_TASKQUEUE`"

msgid "控制Ascend launcher的task queue。"
msgstr "Controls the task queue of the Ascend launcher."

msgid "开启"
msgstr "Enable"

msgid "`TRITON_GRID_WARN_PRINT`"
msgstr "`TRITON_GRID_WARN_PRINT`"

msgid "打印Ascend launcher的grid大小警告。"
msgstr "Print the Ascend launcher grid size warning."

msgid "`NPU_DEVICE_LIMIT`"
msgstr "`NPU_DEVICE_LIMIT`"

msgid "按 `AI Core数,Vector Core数` 限制可用核心数，例如 `14,28`；需符合设备比例。"
msgstr "Limit the number of available cores based on `AI Core count, Vector Core count`, for example `14,28`; the ratio must match the device ratio."

msgid "未设置，使用设备值"
msgstr "If not set, the device value is used."

msgid "工具链选择"
msgstr "Toolchain selection"

msgid "`CC`"
msgstr "`CC`"

msgid "设置CPU launcher扩展的C/C++编译器。"
msgstr "Set the C/C++ compiler for the CPU launcher extension."

msgid "未设置，使用系统默认编译器"
msgstr "If not set, the system default compiler is used."

msgid "`TRITON_NPU_COMPILER_PATH`"
msgstr "`TRITON_NPU_COMPILER_PATH`"

msgid "仅当随包工具与 `PATH` 查找均失败时，作为Ascend编译器工具目录的后备路径。"
msgstr "This serves as the fallback path for the Ascend compiler tool directory only when both the bundled tool and `PATH` lookup fail."

msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_DIR`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_DIR`"

msgid "查找 `triton-opt`、`triton-mlir-opt` 时，在随包工具之后、`PATH` 之前查找该目录的 `bin/`。"
msgstr "When searching for `triton-opt` and `triton-mlir-opt`, search the `bin/` directory of this directory after the bundled tools and before `PATH`."

msgid "triton.knobs接口"
msgstr "triton.knobs interface"

msgid "`triton.knobs` 是社区Triton 3.4引入的类型化配置接口：描述符字段对应一个环境变量，少数条目是Python对象（如回调函数），不对应环境变量，只能在进程内设置。如果只需要在启动前配置一次，直接设置环境变量即可；需要在进程内读取当前取值、临时修改或按作用域恢复时，使用 `triton.knobs`。上游分组由 `triton.knobs` 直接提供；Triton-Ascend在Triton 3.6增加了 `triton.knobs.ascend` 分组，导入Ascend后端后即可使用。"
msgstr "`triton.knobs` is a typed configuration interface introduced in community Triton 3.4. Descriptor fields correspond to an environment variable. A few entries are Python objects (for example, callback functions) that do not correspond to environment variables and can only be set within the process. If you only need to configure once before startup, set the environment variable directly; if you need to read the current value within the process, temporarily modify it, or restore it by scope, use `triton.knobs`. Upstream groups are provided directly by `triton.knobs`; Triton-Ascend added the `triton.knobs.ascend` group in Triton 3.6, which is available after importing the Ascend backend."

msgid "快速上手"
msgstr "Quick Start"

msgid ""
"import triton\n"
"import triton.backends.ascend.runtime  # 触发Ascend后端注册，安装triton.knobs.ascend\n"
"\n"
"# 查看一个分组的全部字段和当前取值\n"
"print(triton.knobs.ascend.knobs)\n"
"\n"
"# 读取、修改某个字段\n"
"print(triton.knobs.compilation.dump_ir)\n"
"triton.knobs.ascend.device_print = True\n"
msgstr ""
"import triton\n"
"import triton.backends.ascend.runtime  # Trigger Ascend backend registration and install triton.knobs.ascend\n"
"\n"
"# View all fields and current values of a group\n"
"print(triton.knobs.ascend.knobs)\n"
"\n"
"# Read and modify a field\n"
"print(triton.knobs.compilation.dump_ir)\n"
"triton.knobs.ascend.device_print = True\n"

msgid "赋值对之后的读取生效，并默认同步写回环境变量，详见下文的读写规则。"
msgstr "The assignment takes effect for subsequent reads and synchronously writes back to the environment variable by default. For details, refer to the read/write rules below."

msgid "读写规则"
msgstr "Read and Write Rules"

msgid "读取：优先返回进程内值，其次环境变量，最后默认值。"
msgstr "Read: Returns the in-process value first, then the environment variable, and finally the default value."

msgid "赋值：写入进程内值，并默认同步写回环境变量。"
msgstr "Assignment: writes an in-process value and synchronously writes it back to the environment variable by default."

msgid "`scope()`：记录进入时的进程内值和环境变量，退出时（包括异常）完整恢复，推荐用于临时切换。"
msgstr "`scope()`: Records the in-process values and environment variables upon entry, and fully restores them upon exit (including exceptions). Use this for temporary switching."

msgid "`reset()` / `knobs.env`：只清除进程内覆盖，不撤销已经写入的环境变量。"
msgstr "`reset()` / `knobs.env`: Clears only in-process overrides and does not undo the environment variables that have already been written."

msgid "`copy()`：复制当前进程内覆盖，返回独立的分组对象。"
msgstr "`copy()`: Copies the current in-process override and returns an independent group object."

msgid "`propagate_env = False`：赋值只影响当前Python进程；子进程和直接读取 `os.getenv` 的工具看不到，确认没有外部读取方时再使用。"
msgstr "`propagate_env = False`: The assignment only affects the current Python process; child processes and tools that directly read `os.getenv` cannot see it. Use this only after confirming that there are no external readers."

msgid "例如临时打开 `device_print`，退出 `with` 块后自动恢复："
msgstr "For example, temporarily enable `device_print`; it automatically restores after you exit the `with` block:"

msgid ""
"with triton.knobs.ascend.scope():\n"
"    triton.knobs.ascend.device_print = True\n"
"    kernel[grid](x, y, out)\n"
"# 退出with块后恢复\n"
msgstr ""
"with triton.knobs.ascend.scope():\n"
"    triton.knobs.ascend.device_print = True\n"
"    kernel[grid](x, y, out)\n"
"# Restored after exiting the with block\n"

msgid "模块级字段"
msgstr "Module-level fields"

msgid "`propagate_env` 作用于 `triton.knobs` 整体，不属于任何分组，也没有对应环境变量，只能通过Python赋值："
msgstr "`propagate_env` applies to `triton.knobs` as a whole. It does not belong to any group and has no corresponding environment variable. It can only be set through Python assignment:"

msgid ""
"triton.knobs.propagate_env = False  # 之后的赋值不再写回os.environ\n"
msgstr ""
"triton.knobs.propagate_env = False  # Subsequent assignments are no longer written back to os.environ\n"

