msgid "编译选项可以直接传入 `kernel[grid](...)`，也可以通过 `triton.Config` 设置自动调优的候选配置。`triton.Config` 的 `num_warps`、`num_stages` 和 `ir_override` 使用独立构造参数，其余受支持的编译选项放在 `kwargs` 中。"
msgstr "You can pass compilation options directly to `kernel[grid](...)` or set them through `triton.Config` for autotuning candidate configurations. In `triton.Config`, `num_warps`, `num_stages`, and `ir_override` use independent constructor parameters, and the remaining supported compilation options are placed in `kwargs`."

msgid "示例中，`BLOCK_SIZE` 是kernel自定义的 `tl.constexpr` 参数，`compile_mode` 和 `num_stages` 是编译选项："
msgstr "In this example, `BLOCK_SIZE` is a custom `tl.constexpr` parameter defined by the kernel, and `compile_mode` and `num_stages` are compilation options:"

msgid ""
"import triton\n"
"\n"
"kernel[grid](*args, BLOCK_SIZE=1024, compile_mode=\"simd\", num_stages=1)\n"
"\n"
"configs = [\n"
"    triton.Config({\"BLOCK_SIZE\": 1024, \"compile_mode\": \"simd\"}, num_stages=1),\n"
"    triton.Config({\"BLOCK_SIZE\": 1024, \"compile_mode\": \"simd\"}, num_stages=2),\n"
"]\n"
msgstr ""
"import triton\n"
"\n"
"kernel[grid](*args, BLOCK_SIZE=1024, compile_mode=\"simd\", num_stages=1)\n"
"\n"
"configs = [\n"
"    triton.Config({\"BLOCK_SIZE\": 1024, \"compile_mode\": \"simd\"}, num_stages=1),\n"
"    triton.Config({\"BLOCK_SIZE\": 1024, \"compile_mode\": \"simd\"}, num_stages=2),\n"
"]\n"

msgid "候选配置的使用方法见 [Autotune使用指南](./autotune_guide.md)。"
msgstr "For the usage of candidate configurations, refer to the [Autotune Usage Guide](./autotune_guide.md)."

