msgstr "The default values in the table are based on the Ascend backend, and differences in `triton.Config` are noted separately; `None` usually indicates that the backend or toolchain determines the value."

msgid "**常规路径**：`compile_mode=\"simd\"` 或 `\"simd_simt_template\"`。"
msgstr "**Standard path**: `compile_mode=\"simd\"` or `\"simd_simt_template\"`."

msgid "**仅纯SIMT**：`compile_mode=\"simt_only\"`，仅950支持。"
msgstr "**SIMT only**: `compile_mode=\"simt_only\"`, supported only on 950."

msgid "**需DynamicCV生效**：编译器成功应用了 [DynamicCV流水优化](./architecture_design_and_core_features.md#dynamic-cv-pipeline)，即950常规路径中启用 `enable_dynamic_cv_pipeline=True`，且未发生回退。"
msgstr "**Requires DynamicCV to take effect**: The compiler successfully applied the [DynamicCV pipeline optimization](./architecture_design_and_core_features.md#dynamic-cv-pipeline), that is, `enable_dynamic_cv_pipeline=True` is enabled in the 950 regular path, and no fallback occurred."

msgid "默认值/可选值"
msgstr "Default value/Optional value"

msgid "Triton通用"
msgstr "Triton General"

msgid "开启设备断言与编译调试；JIT下与环境变量 `TRITON_DEBUG` 任一开启即生效。"
msgstr "Enables device assertion and compilation debugging. This takes effect when either JIT or the environment variable `TRITON_DEBUG` is enabled."

msgid "`False`；布尔值"
msgstr "`False`; boolean value"

msgid "`sanitize_overflow`"
msgstr "`sanitize_overflow`"

