msgstr "`None`; must contain a four-level dictionary with positive 32-bit signed integer values"

msgid "`set_workspace_multibuffer`"
msgstr "`set_workspace_multibuffer`"

msgid "设置workspace多缓冲级别；显式设置 `multibuffer_mode` 且 `gm>1` 时，NPU IR使用该GM槽数覆盖本值。"
msgstr "Sets the workspace multi-buffer level. When `multibuffer_mode` is explicitly set and `gm>1`, the NPU IR uses the GM slot count to override this value."

msgid "`None`；整数，具体范围由NPU编译器决定"
msgstr "`None`; an integer, with the specific range determined by the NPU compiler"

