msgid "<a id=\"compiler-option-cleanup-and-compatibility\">"
msgstr "<a id=\"compiler-option-cleanup-and-compatibility\">"

msgid "编译选项清理与兼容性"
msgstr "Compilation Option Cleanup and Compatibility"

msgid "本节列出的旧编译选项仅在兼容期内接受。**未来版本彻底移除这些选项后，继续通过kernel启动参数或 `triton.Config` 传入它们将导致报错。** 请在升级前按下表迁移或删除旧选项。"
msgstr "The legacy compilation options listed in this section are accepted only during the compatibility period. **Once future versions completely remove these options, passing them using kernel launch parameters or `triton.Config` will result in an error.** Migrate or delete the legacy options according to the following table before upgrading."

msgid "由Triton-Ascend处理的更名和废弃项会发出 `FutureWarning`，同一名称在进程内只告警一次。旧多缓冲选项由NPU IR输出废弃提示。"
msgstr "Renaming and deprecation items handled by Triton-Ascend emit a `FutureWarning`, and the same name triggers a warning only once within a process. The NPU IR outputs a deprecation message for the old multi-buffer option."

msgid "旧多缓冲选项迁移"
msgstr "Legacy Multi-buffer Option Migration"

msgid "以下三个选项由NPU IR标记为废弃。兼容期内仍按旧语义生效；同时设置 `multibuffer_mode` 时，旧选项的取值被忽略。可按编译器提示的等效配置迁移，并在字典中完整指定四个层级："
msgstr "The NPU IR marks the following three options as deprecated. During the compatibility period, they still take effect with the old semantics. When you set `multibuffer_mode` at the same time, the system ignores the values of the old options. You can migrate to the equivalent configuration suggested by the compiler and fully specify the four levels in the dictionary:"

msgid "旧选项"
msgstr "Legacy option"

msgid "`multibuffer_mode` 中的对应设置"
msgstr "the corresponding settings in `multibuffer_mode`"

msgid "`limit_auto_multi_buffer_only_for_local_buffer`"
msgstr "`limit_auto_multi_buffer_only_for_local_buffer`"

msgid "`True` 对应 `gm=1`，关闭GM多缓冲。"
msgstr "`True` corresponds to `gm=1` and disables GM multi-buffering."

msgid "`limit_auto_multi_buffer_of_local_buffer`"
msgstr "`limit_auto_multi_buffer_of_local_buffer`"

msgid "`\"no-l0c\"` 对应 `l0c=1`；`\"no-limit\"` 对应 `l0c>1`。"
msgstr "`\"no-l0c\"` corresponds to `l0c=1`; `\"no-limit\"` corresponds to `l0c>1`."

msgid "`limit_auto_multi_buffer_buffer`"
msgstr "`limit_auto_multi_buffer_buffer`"

msgid "950常规路径：`\"only-cube\"` 对应 `ub=1`；`\"only-vector\"` 对应 `l1=1`、`l0c=1`；`\"no-limit\"` 对应 `l1>1`、`ub>1`。"
msgstr "950 regular path: `\"only-cube\"` corresponds to `ub=1`; `\"only-vector\"` corresponds to `l1=1` and `l0c=1`; `\"no-limit\"` corresponds to `l1>1` and `ub>1`."

msgid "例如，仅为L1配置双缓冲："
msgstr "For example, configure double buffering only for L1:"

